    0\leq \frac{u^\top(B-A)u}{u^\top u} \leq \max_{x\neq0}\left\{\frac{x^\top Bx}{x^\top x}\right\} - \frac{u^\top(B-A)u}{u^\top u} = \lambda_{\max}(B) - \lambda_{\max}(A). 
\end{equation}

    Similarly, $A\succeq-B$ indicates that $B-(-A)\succeq0$, then \eqref{lm:B.1-2} immediately gives
